# Forever Beast Mastery Hunter, Turret Hawk (provisional: no in-game check yet; shots without weaving, the hawks and the
# target's debuffs modelled from our casts): Aspect of the Hawk and Hunter's Mark before combat; Hunter's Mark on a new
# target and Serpent Sting when it drops at tier 2; Rapid Fire on cooldown; two Summon Hawk guardians up, then Arcane
# Shot on their shared cooldown, Aimed Shot and Multi-Shot on more targets (after wowsims/forever's Turret Hawk APL,
# reference only). Shots only outside the deadzone (Auto Shot in range). Arcane Shot's mana floor is a setting, off by
# default.

actions.precombat=aspect_of_the_hawk,if=!buff.aspect_of_the_hawk.up
actions.precombat+=/hunters_mark,if=!debuff.hunters_mark.up
actions=aspect_of_the_hawk,if=!buff.aspect_of_the_hawk.up
actions+=/hunters_mark,focus=2,if=!debuff.hunters_mark.up
actions+=/rapid_fire,use_off_gcd=1
actions+=/call_action_list,name=shots,if=action.auto_shot.in_range
actions.shots=summon_hawk,if=pet.hawk.count<2
actions.shots+=/arcane_shot,if=mana.pct>=settings.arcane_shot_mana
actions.shots+=/serpent_sting,focus=2,if=!debuff.serpent_sting.up
actions.shots+=/aimed_shot
actions.shots+=/multi_shot,if=active_enemies>1
